msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non, c’est sa manière de me parler, c’est tout..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ECD0EA2D_CADC_476B_802B_330AC5782E94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59077b4ad376bc855c81619e6ea98f83af9aabed05b161d17598b0d040ce03c8
